OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few bright spells in the east
OL,6,Fat first otherwise cloudy with
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain, heavy at times in
OL,8,Fthe west, spreading east in the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Quite breezy around the
OL,10,Fcoasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,13,Fheavy rain spreading east through the
OL,14,Fevening. Further outbreaks of heavy
OL,15,Frain overnight, perhaps thundery for a
OL,16,Ftime, then turning more showery
OL,17,Ftowards morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
