OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FFrequent showers feed in from
OL,6,Fthe northwest through the day, heavy
OL,7,Fand thundery at times. Best of any
OL,8,Fbrighter spells in the east.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,11,FShowers Wednesday morning, becoming
OL,12,Fdry and bright by midday. A band of
OL,13,Fheavy rain pushes east Wednesday
OL,14,Fevening. Frequent heavy showers on
OL,15,FThursday, easing Friday morning, then
OL,16,Ffurther rain later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
